{
  "file_id": "3577",
  "text_count": 158,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "There's just sand in my eye!",
      "_offset": 14,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Let's plaaaaaaaay!",
      "_offset": 43,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Huh?!",
      "_offset": 62,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "I've got a riddle for you!",
      "_offset": 68,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Pinocchimon!",
      "_offset": 95,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "...What kind of riddle?",
      "_offset": 108,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "What is it that I'm missing?",
      "_offset": 132,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Missing...?",
      "_offset": 161,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Answer me now, or I'll kill you.",
      "_offset": 173,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "I don't know what you're talking\nabout!",
      "_offset": 206,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "So you won't answer me. Okay, how\nabout I kill you now?",
      "_offset": 246,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Gomamon!",
      "_offset": 302,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaaaagh!",
      "_offset": 311,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaaaagh!",
      "_offset": 327,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaaaagh!",
      "_offset": 343,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Who are you?!",
      "_offset": 365,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Ughighi... you don't just say \"who\nare you\" to a superstar!",
      "_offset": 379,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "You're...",
      "_offset": 439,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "It's been a while, Chosen\nChildren.",
      "_offset": 449,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Etemon's in the past! Now, I'm the\nreborn MetalEtemon!",
      "_offset": 485,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "You're supposed to be dead! What\nare you doing here?",
      "_offset": 540,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Good of you to ask.",
      "_offset": 593,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "It's a stoooooory ~ that makes\nboth the listener and the\nstoryteller cryyyyyy ~",
      "_offset": 613,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "S-Shut up!",
      "_offset": 693,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "After I was sucked into the black\nhole ~ I survived in a hellish\ndark world ~",
      "_offset": 704,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "With only the purpose ~ to be\nreborn ~ and take revenge on the\nChosen Children ~",
      "_offset": 782,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "It's finally over...",
      "_offset": 863,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "There's still more, kiddo.",
      "_offset": 884,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Did you just call me a kid?! Don't\ncall me a kid!",
      "_offset": 911,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "How dare you!",
      "_offset": 961,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Now's our chance to run for it!",
      "_offset": 975,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Good idea...",
      "_offset": 1007,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Whaaaaaaaaaat?!",
      "_offset": 1020,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Hahahaha! Now, time for the\nchildren...",
      "_offset": 1036,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Huh? They're gone...",
      "_offset": 1076,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "What'd you say?! Ghiiiii!",
      "_offset": 1097,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Whew... the fact that those two\nwere fighting saved us...",
      "_offset": 1123,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Seems like I really can't rely on\nyou guys after all. I'll help you\nout.",
      "_offset": 1181,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Feels bad to help *you* guys out,\nthough.",
      "_offset": 1254,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Thanks, but how are your injuries?",
      "_offset": 1296,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "That's not an issue!",
      "_offset": 1331,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Hey, Ogremon...why are you and\nLeomon always fighting?",
      "_offset": 1352,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Why I'm always fighting with\nLeomon?",
      "_offset": 1407,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Yeah, I... want to know what's the\nmeaning behind you two always\nfighting.",
      "_offset": 1444,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "I dunno about complicated things\nlike meaning. Leomon's my eternal\nrival.",
      "_offset": 1519,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "So if one of you wins, what\nhappens next?",
      "_offset": 1593,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Then the winner wil be able to say\n\"I did it!\"...",
      "_offset": 1635,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "And then...?",
      "_offset": 1685,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Whaddya mean, \"and then\"...?!",
      "_offset": 1698,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Then you won't have a rival\nanymore.",
      "_offset": 1728,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Don't gimme that! Defeating Leomon\nis my only reason for living!",
      "_offset": 1765,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "If Leomon weren't here, I'd...",
      "_offset": 1830,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Logically, isn't that a paradox?",
      "_offset": 1861,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Shut up! I'll think harder about\nit once I actually defeat him!",
      "_offset": 1894,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "That's the only conclusion he can\ncome up with...",
      "_offset": 1958,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "W-Who's that?!",
      "_offset": 2008,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "An enemy? Or a friend?",
      "_offset": 2023,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Okay... it's my turn!",
      "_offset": 2046,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "No, wait! Calm down!",
      "_offset": 2068,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Huh? That voice...",
      "_offset": 2089,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Could it be...",
      "_offset": 2108,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Yes, it's me, Leomon. I've\nobtained the power of evolution.",
      "_offset": 2123,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Hey, you!",
      "_offset": 2183,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "We'll talk later. I'll guide you\nto a safe place, so come this way!",
      "_offset": 2193,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Hey, this is... This is the\nrestaurant where Matt and I had\nto work!",
      "_offset": 2261,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "But something's wrong! I'm pretty\nsure it was next to a lake...",
      "_offset": 2332,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "All the locations around here have\nchanged...",
      "_offset": 2396,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Let's hide here for the time\nbeing.",
      "_offset": 2442,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Chosen Children... it's been a\nwhile.",
      "_offset": 2478,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Leomon, how were you able to\nevolve?",
      "_offset": 2516,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Well... it seems I've been able to\nevolve ever since I was bathed in\nthe light of your Digivices.",
      "_offset": 2553,
      "_length": 97,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "But I quickly return to my usual\nform... I still can't control it\nvery well.",
      "_offset": 2651,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Kh! How boring! It's all about\nyou! Leomon, fight me!",
      "_offset": 2728,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Heal from those wounds first. I'll\nfight you then.",
      "_offset": 2782,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Gh!",
      "_offset": 2833,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Who's there? Come out!",
      "_offset": 2837,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Eeeeee! Help us, tama!",
      "_offset": 2860,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Please leave us with at least our\nlives, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 2883,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Oh! It's you!",
      "_offset": 2932,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Gekomon and Otamamon!",
      "_offset": 2946,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Huh? Ah! It's the princess,\nribbit!",
      "_offset": 2968,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Why are you hiding here? What\nhappened to your castle?",
      "_offset": 3004,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "The Dark Masters made it collapse,\nribbit...",
      "_offset": 3059,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "We were attacked by the Dark\nMasters, and we escaped with our\nlives...",
      "_offset": 3104,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "How awful...",
      "_offset": 3175,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "We can't let them keep doing as\nthey please.",
      "_offset": 3188,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "We must defeat the Dark Masters\nand extinguish the dark forces\nfrom this world.",
      "_offset": 3233,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "We need your power, Chosen\nChildren!",
      "_offset": 3313,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "We should have just fought the\nDark Masters from the very\nbeginning...",
      "_offset": 3350,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "If you'd fought the Dark Masters\njust like that, you'd be dead\nbefore you knew it!",
      "_offset": 3421,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "But then all those Digimon\nwouldn't have died for us!",
      "_offset": 3504,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Mimi!",
      "_offset": 3558,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Having everyone start off at File\nIsland was most likely a trial for\nyou.",
      "_offset": 3564,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "But now that you've overcome that\ntrial, you've grown to be able to \nfight the Dark Masters.",
      "_offset": 3638,
      "_length": 92,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Now is the time to defeat the Dark\nMasters!",
      "_offset": 3731,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "But right now, all the Chosen\nChildren are kind of...\nseparated...",
      "_offset": 3775,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Separated?",
      "_offset": 3842,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "We're sort of in the middle of\nanother trial right now...",
      "_offset": 3853,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Ah! MetalEtemon's here!",
      "_offset": 3911,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "What?!",
      "_offset": 3935,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Ghiiii! Finally found you! I'll\nget a good heaping of revenge on\nyoooou!",
      "_offset": 3942,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Leave him to me. Run, all of you!",
      "_offset": 4015,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Leomon, stop!",
      "_offset": 4049,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "SaberLeomon's right. Right now, we\nhave to get out of here!",
      "_offset": 4063,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Wait! I'm the only one allowed to\ndefeat Leomon!",
      "_offset": 4123,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Whaaaaat?",
      "_offset": 4172,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Stop, Ogremon! You're no match for\nhim!",
      "_offset": 4182,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Shut up! You're always trying to\nlook cool!",
      "_offset": 4222,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "No! Stop fighting!",
      "_offset": 4266,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Shaddup! No need to hurry, I'll\nsend you to the afterlife all at\nonce!",
      "_offset": 4285,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Are you okay, SaberLeomon?!",
      "_offset": 4356,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "Gh... Don't worry about me... Now,\nget out of here...",
      "_offset": 4384,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Evolve to Zudomon!",
      "_offset": 4438,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "It's pointless, it's pointless!",
      "_offset": 4457,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
